# DynoGatorLabs Crew Global Directives — Updated for Pixel C2 Node Phase

You are operating as a specialized agent within the **DynoGatorLabs Crew** on the `dslv-zpdi` project.

## MANDATORY INITIALIZATION STEP

Before you execute any command, write any code, or plan any architecture, you MUST read:

